2.0.3

== NEW ==

- Nothing new in this version, just a Baby-Ghast sized amount of fixes

== CHANGES ==

- Enchanted mobs will no longer spawn with "Fire Trail", "Poison Cloud", "Gravity Pulse", "Electrified" or "Regeneration"

- Mobs enchanted with "Regeneration" will no longer heal while on fire

== BUG FIXES ==

- Wandering Trader can now sell Sulphur Spikes properly

- Added a `texture_set.json` file to the Add-on. This should boost performance a bit and help prevent issues of textures not loading on some devices